    "detailed_description": "Alpine is a Skiing Arcade Game where your objective is to avoid rocks and other skiers while zooming down a mountain at lightning fast speeds! Collect power-ups to help you on your mission to conquer the mountain! Collect coins to purchase new gear from Badger\u2019s shop! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928790/extras/50e3c292ea8018997413642475d55fa8.avif?t=1753352069\" width=600 height=200 /></span><br><br><strong>ROCKET</strong>: Strap a lit rocket to your back and let the force push you down the mountain at such high speeds that any rock in your way gets torn to shreds!<br><br><strong>SLEDGE HAMMER</strong>: SMASH your way through any and all rocks in your way with this BRUTAL sledge hammer!<br><br><strong>BANKER</strong>: Let Frank the Bankman take care of your finances and DOUBLE the amount of coins you collect!<br><br><strong>MAGNET</strong>: Sleeping on the job? No problem! With this power up you don't even have to collect coins, they just fly towards you!<br><br><strong>GYMNAST</strong>: Thanks to your dedication to NEVER skipping leg day at the gym, you can now JUMP over rocks effortlessly!<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928790/extras/717c0c4b2d4238acc8212f5a66f62783.avif?t=1753352069\" width=600 height=200 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Use our <strong>Centralised High Efficiency Storage Trunk</strong> or C H E S T for short to store all of your belongings and switch out power-ups!<br><br></li><li>Purchase new power-ups from Badgers shop!<br><br></li><li>Collect coins!<br><br></li><li>Break <strong>golden rocks</strong> to get extra coins! <br><br></li><li>Play through 10 challenging levels!</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "Alpine is a Skiing Arcade Game where your objective is to avoid rocks and other skiers while zooming down a mountain at lightning fast speeds! Collect power-ups to help you on your mission to conquer the mountain! Collect coins to purchase new gear from Badger\u2019s shop! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928790/extras/50e3c292ea8018997413642475d55fa8.avif?t=1753352069\" width=600 height=200 /></span><br><br><strong>ROCKET</strong>: Strap a lit rocket to your back and let the force push you down the mountain at such high speeds that any rock in your way gets torn to shreds!<br><br><strong>SLEDGE HAMMER</strong>: SMASH your way through any and all rocks in your way with this BRUTAL sledge hammer!<br><br><strong>BANKER</strong>: Let Frank the Bankman take care of your finances and DOUBLE the amount of coins you collect!<br><br><strong>MAGNET</strong>: Sleeping on the job? No problem! With this power up you don't even have to collect coins, they just fly towards you!<br><br><strong>GYMNAST</strong>: Thanks to your dedication to NEVER skipping leg day at the gym, you can now JUMP over rocks effortlessly!<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928790/extras/717c0c4b2d4238acc8212f5a66f62783.avif?t=1753352069\" width=600 height=200 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Use our <strong>Centralised High Efficiency Storage Trunk</strong> or C H E S T for short to store all of your belongings and switch out power-ups!<br><br></li><li>Purchase new power-ups from Badgers shop!<br><br></li><li>Collect coins!<br><br></li><li>Break <strong>golden rocks</strong> to get extra coins! <br><br></li><li>Play through 10 challenging levels!</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Alpine is a Skiing Arcade Game where your objective is to avoid rocks and other skiers while zooming down a mountain at lightning fast speeds! Collect power ups to help you on your mission to conquer the mountain! Collect coins to purchase new gear from Badger\u2019s shop!",
